---
manual: events.leave
lines: [2251, 2255]
testability: interactive
display: native
ledger: H5
----------- app code
$left = []
Shoes.app width: 400, height: 300 do
  $slot = stack width: 200, height: 100 do
    leave { |slot| $left << slot }
  end
end
----------- test code
move_mouse 50, 50
move_mouse 300, 200
assert_equal [$slot], $left, "the block gets the slot being left"
